<title>UK: UK approves Banff field development - Hardy.</title>
<headline>UK approves Banff field development - Hardy.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain has approved the full development of the North Sea Banff oil field after a successful completion of a six month producution assessment, Hardy Oil &amp; Gas Plc said.</p>
<p>The assessment maintained a daily production rate of about 35,000 barrels of oil, it added.</p>
</text>
